* OctBlock component reference -- the "## Example" netlist verbatim. No --features python build
* needed -- octblock builds and runs unconditionally, only octave-cli itself needs to be
* installed and on PATH at run time. No title line -- see doc-verify/pid/example.cir's own
* comment.
SRC kind=const value=3
* G1 accumulates SRC every step (see accum/accumulate.m): row N's own G1 = 3*N (state advances
* by SRC every resolved step, starting from state=0).
G1 kind=octblock path=doc-verify/octblock/accum function=accumulate in=SRC
